# Allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless named here.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.nvmrc
!**/package.json
!contract
!animus/src
!threshold/mcp
!threshold/mcp-mock
# The runtime reads the shard file (cli.ts, config.ts) and imports one repo-checks module (main.ts). Nothing else
# of tools/ or shards/ is needed; the shard file holds no secret (secrets come from /run/secrets).
!shards/phase0.yaml
!tools/repo-checks/src/identity-mode.ts
# The re-include above also matches every installed package.json; drop installed trees.
**/node_modules/**
**/node_modules
**/*.test.ts
threshold/mcp-mock/test-support
threshold/mcp/test-support
**/.env*
**/*tokens*.json
**/secrets
